fixture cam_wall_slide
doc BUILD.md s5 Wall "Wall-cling: slide at 180 u/s for up to 90 f, then normal fall"; docs/adr/0011: a slide is a rest height that moves down with the player; the fall after it looks ahead
room test/camera
spawn 4470 2000
frames 260
input
  0..259 R
end
expect
  mark cling 0..20 event.wall_cling=1
  during cling+1..cling+80 state=wall
  mark land cling+80..259 event.land=1
  at land y=3200u
end
